{"seq":4,"slug":"full-text-search","title":"全文搜索 FTS5","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/advanced-sql/full-text-search","wordCount":617,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"全文搜索-fts5\">全文搜索 FTS5</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>FTS5</strong> 是 SQLite 内置的全文搜索引擎，通过<strong>虚拟表</strong>（Virtual Table）实现。它为文本建立<strong>倒排索引</strong>，从而支持关键词检索、短语匹配、布尔查询和相关性排序——这些是 <code>LIKE &#39;%...%&#39;</code> 无法高效完成的。相比 FTS3/FTS4，FTS5 提供完整的布尔查询语法和内置的 <code>bm25()</code> 排名函数。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"fts5-概述\">FTS5 概述</h2><p><strong>FTS5</strong>（Full-Text Search 5）是 SQLite 内置的全文搜索引擎，通过<strong>虚拟表</strong>（Virtual Table）机制实现。它为文本内容建立倒排索引，支持高效的关键词检索、短语匹配、布尔查询和相关性排序。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    DOC[文档内容] --&gt; TOKENIZER[分词器&lt;br/&gt;Tokenizer]&#10;    TOKENIZER --&gt; INDEX[倒排索引&lt;br/&gt;Inverted Index]&#10;    QUERY[搜索查询] --&gt; MATCH[MATCH 引擎]&#10;    INDEX --&gt; MATCH&#10;    MATCH --&gt; RESULTS[排序结果]\">graph LR\n    DOC[文档内容] --&gt; TOKENIZER[分词器&lt;br/&gt;Tokenizer]\n    TOKENIZER --&gt; INDEX[倒排索引&lt;br/&gt;Inverted Index]\n    QUERY[搜索查询] --&gt; MATCH[MATCH 引擎]\n    INDEX --&gt; MATCH\n    MATCH --&gt; RESULTS[排序结果]</pre><p>FTS5 相比 FTS3/FTS4 的改进：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>FTS3/FTS4</th>\n<th>FTS5</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>查询语法</td>\n<td>简单匹配</td>\n<td>完整布尔表达式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排名函数</td>\n<td>需自定义</td>\n<td>内置 bm25()</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>更优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义分词器</td>\n<td>C API</td>\n<td>C API + fts5vocab</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>列过滤</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"创建-fts5-表\">创建 FTS5 表</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 基本 FTS5 表&#10;CREATE VIRTUAL TABLE articles USING fts5(&#10;    title,&#10;    body,&#10;    author&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 指定分词器&#10;CREATE VIRTUAL TABLE articles_cn USING fts5(&#10;    title,&#10;    body,&#10;    tokenize = &#39;unicode61&#39;&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 关联外部内容表（content table）&#10;CREATE TABLE articles_data (&#10;    id     INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    title  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;    body   TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;    author TEXT NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE VIRTUAL TABLE articles_idx USING fts5(&#10;    title,&#10;    body,&#10;    author,&#10;    content = &#39;articles_data&#39;,&#10;    content_rowid = &#39;id&#39;&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 插入测试数据&#10;INSERT INTO articles (title, body, author) VALUES&#10;(&#39;SQLite 入门指南&#39;, &#39;SQLite 是一个轻量级的嵌入式数据库引擎，适合移动端和桌面应用开发&#39;, &#39;张三&#39;),&#10;(&#39;数据库索引优化&#39;, &#39;合理使用索引可以显著提升查询性能，B-tree 索引是最常见的索引类型&#39;, &#39;李四&#39;),&#10;(&#39;全文搜索实战&#39;, &#39;全文搜索引擎通过倒排索引实现高效的文本检索，FTS5 是 SQLite 的推荐方案&#39;, &#39;张三&#39;),&#10;(&#39;WAL 模式详解&#39;, &#39;WAL 预写日志模式是 SQLite 最推荐的日志模式，支持读写并发&#39;, &#39;王五&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 基本 FTS5 表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> VIRTUAL </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fts5(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    title,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    body,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    author</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 指定分词器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> VIRTUAL </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles_cn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fts5(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    title,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    body,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tokenize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'unicode61'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 关联外部内容表（content table）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> articles_data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    title  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    body   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    author </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> VIRTUAL </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles_idx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fts5(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    title,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    body,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    author,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    content </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'articles_data'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    content_rowid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'id'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 插入测试数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles (title, body, author) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SQLite 入门指南'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SQLite 是一个轻量级的嵌入式数据库引擎，适合移动端和桌面应用开发'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'张三'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'数据库索引优化'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'合理使用索引可以显著提升查询性能，B-tree 索引是最常见的索引类型'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'李四'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'全文搜索实战'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'全文搜索引擎通过倒排索引实现高效的文本检索，FTS5 是 SQLite 的推荐方案'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'张三'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'WAL 模式详解'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'WAL 预写日志模式是 SQLite 最推荐的日志模式，支持读写并发'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'王五'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"基本查询\">基本查询</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 简单关键词搜索&#10;SELECT * FROM articles WHERE articles MATCH &#39;SQLite&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 多关键词（隐式 AND）&#10;SELECT * FROM articles WHERE articles MATCH &#39;SQLite 数据库&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 指定列搜索&#10;SELECT * FROM articles WHERE articles MATCH &#39;title:SQLite&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 短语匹配（精确词序）&#10;SELECT * FROM articles WHERE articles MATCH &#39;&quot;嵌入式数据库&quot;&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 简单关键词搜索</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MATCH</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'SQLite'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 多关键词（隐式 AND）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MATCH</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'SQLite 数据库'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 指定列搜索</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MATCH</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'title:SQLite'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 短语匹配（精确词序）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MATCH</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '\"嵌入式数据库\"'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>查询语法</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>word</td>\n<td>包含该词的文档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>word1 word2</td>\n<td>同时包含两个词（AND）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>word1 OR word2</td>\n<td>包含任一词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>word1 NOT word2</td>\n<td>包含 word1 但不含 word2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;phrase match&quot;</td>\n<td>精确短语匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>word*</td>\n<td>前缀匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NEAR(w1 w2, n)</td>\n<td>两词间隔不超过 n 个词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>{col1 col2}: word</td>\n<td>在指定列中搜索</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 布尔查询&#10;SELECT * FROM articles WHERE articles MATCH &#39;SQLite OR 索引&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- NOT 查询&#10;SELECT * FROM articles WHERE articles MATCH &#39;SQLite NOT WAL&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 前缀搜索&#10;SELECT * FROM articles WHERE articles MATCH &#39;数据*&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- NEAR 查询：两个词相距不超过 5 个词&#10;SELECT * FROM articles WHERE articles MATCH &#39;NEAR(SQLite 嵌入式, 5)&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 多列搜索&#10;SELECT * FROM articles WHERE articles MATCH &#39;{title body}: SQLite&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 布尔查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MATCH</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'SQLite OR 索引'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- NOT 查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MATCH</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'SQLite NOT WAL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 前缀搜索</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MATCH</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '数据*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- NEAR 查询：两个词相距不超过 5 个词</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MATCH</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'NEAR(SQLite 嵌入式, 5)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 多列搜索</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MATCH</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{title body}: SQLite'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"排序与相关性\">排序与相关性</h2><p>FTS5 内置 <strong>bm25()</strong> 排名函数，基于 BM25 算法计算文档与查询的相关性分数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 按相关性排序&#10;SELECT&#10;    title,&#10;    author,&#10;    rank&#10;FROM articles&#10;WHERE articles MATCH &#39;SQLite&#39;&#10;ORDER BY rank;&#10;&#10;-- bm25() 可以为不同列指定权重&#10;SELECT&#10;    title,&#10;    author,&#10;    bm25(articles, 10.0, 1.0, 5.0) AS weighted_rank&#10;FROM articles&#10;WHERE articles MATCH &#39;SQLite&#39;&#10;ORDER BY weighted_rank;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按相关性排序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    title,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    author,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rank</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MATCH</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'SQLite'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rank;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- bm25() 可以为不同列指定权重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    title,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    author,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bm25(articles, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weighted_rank</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MATCH</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'SQLite'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weighted_rank;</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    QUERY[查询词] --&gt; BM25[BM25 算法]&#10;    TF[词频 TF] --&gt; BM25&#10;    IDF[逆文档频率 IDF] --&gt; BM25&#10;    DL[文档长度] --&gt; BM25&#10;    BM25 --&gt; SCORE[相关性分数]\">graph TD\n    QUERY[查询词] --&gt; BM25[BM25 算法]\n    TF[词频 TF] --&gt; BM25\n    IDF[逆文档频率 IDF] --&gt; BM25\n    DL[文档长度] --&gt; BM25\n    BM25 --&gt; SCORE[相关性分数]</pre><p>bm25() 的列权重参数顺序与 CREATE VIRTUAL TABLE 中的列顺序一致。权重越高，该列的匹配对最终分数的影响越大。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> FTS5 的 <code>rank</code> 列是内置的快捷方式，等价于 <code>bm25(table_name)</code>。使用 <code>ORDER BY rank</code> 即可按默认权重排序。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"高亮与摘要\">高亮与摘要</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- highlight()：高亮匹配词&#10;SELECT&#10;    highlight(articles, 0, &#39;&lt;b&gt;&#39;, &#39;&lt;/b&gt;&#39;) AS highlighted_title,&#10;    highlight(articles, 1, &#39;&lt;b&gt;&#39;, &#39;&lt;/b&gt;&#39;) AS highlighted_body&#10;FROM articles&#10;WHERE articles MATCH &#39;SQLite&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- snippet()：生成包含匹配词的文本摘要&#10;SELECT&#10;    title,&#10;    snippet(articles, 1, &#39;&lt;b&gt;&#39;, &#39;&lt;/b&gt;&#39;, &#39;...&#39;, 20) AS body_snippet&#10;FROM articles&#10;WHERE articles MATCH &#39;索引&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- highlight()：高亮匹配词</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    highlight(articles, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C;b>'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C;/b>'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> highlighted_title,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    highlight(articles, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C;b>'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C;/b>'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> highlighted_body</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MATCH</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'SQLite'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- snippet()：生成包含匹配词的文本摘要</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    title,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    snippet(articles, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C;b>'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C;/b>'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'...'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body_snippet</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MATCH</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '索引'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>highlight</td>\n<td>(table, col_idx, open_tag, close_tag)</td>\n<td>全文高亮</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>snippet</td>\n<td>(table, col_idx, open, close, ellip, max)</td>\n<td>摘要提取</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"辅助表与词汇表\">辅助表与词汇表</h2><p>FTS5 提供 <strong>fts5vocab</strong> 虚拟表用于查看索引的内部统计信息：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 创建词汇统计表&#10;CREATE VIRTUAL TABLE articles_vocab USING fts5vocab(articles, &#39;row&#39;);&#10;&#10;-- 查看所有索引词及其文档频率&#10;SELECT term, doc AS doc_count, cnt AS total_count&#10;FROM articles_vocab&#10;ORDER BY doc_count DESC&#10;LIMIT 20;&#10;&#10;-- 按列统计&#10;CREATE VIRTUAL TABLE articles_vocab_col USING fts5vocab(articles, &#39;col&#39;);&#10;&#10;SELECT term, col, doc, cnt&#10;FROM articles_vocab_col&#10;WHERE col = &#39;title&#39;&#10;ORDER BY cnt DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 创建词汇统计表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> VIRTUAL </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles_vocab </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fts5vocab(articles, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'row'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看所有索引词及其文档频率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> term, doc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> doc_count, cnt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=